      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i wont double it if it's that bad. but the dizziness is actually making it hard to walk around the house. i dont really want to call the doctor every time i feel a bit off, it's such a hassle. is there any way i can just take a higher dose once a day instead of twice, or maybe take an aspirin with it to help with the feeling? i just want to feel normal again without having to go in for more appointments.",
